config TOUCHSCREEN_ITK9881H
	tristate "Ilitek ITK9881H SPI touchscreen (Xiaomi Redmi 8 / olive)"
	depends on SPI && OF && REGULATOR && GPIO_LIB
	help
	  Say Y or M here to add support for the Ilitek ITK9881H (ILI9881H)
	  touch controller used on the Xiaomi Redmi 8 (olive) incell panel.

	  The controller sits on SPI3 (CS0), with reset on gpio64 and IRQ on
	  gpio65, powered by vdd/vcc at 1.8 V.

	  If unsure, say N.
